  "(Go to him.)": "（去找他。）",
  "(He holds the letter as if it might burn him.) It says: the matter is settled; go home to your families; leave the fort. ʿÁbid swears the whole camp has been won over.": "（他拿着信，仿佛它会灼伤他的手。）信上说：事情已经了结；回到你们的家人身边去；离开堡垒。阿比德发誓说，整个营地都已被争取过来了。",
  "(He is older than his voice, grey in the beard, the road still in the creases of his cloak.) A son of this quarter. You walked out on the road to meet me, I think, against the governor's word. Sit, sit. I have come home, you see.": "（他比声音听起来苍老，胡须已灰白，斗篷的褶皱里仍带着旅途的风尘。）这个街区的孩子。我想，你是不顾总督的命令，走上大路来迎我的。坐，坐。你看，我回家了。",
  "(He looks hard at you, then laughs and takes both your hands.) The uncle's door in Shíráz! You stood there beside me. Four years, and that door has opened on half of Persia. Mullá Ḥusayn and Quddús have gone ahead of us since. And I have come home.": "（他定睛看你，随即笑了，握住你的双手。）在设拉子叔父的门前！你当时就站在我身旁。四年过去，那扇门已向半个波斯敞开。毛拉·侯赛因和古杜斯此后都先我们而去了。而我，回家了。",
  "(He says it quietly, as a man tells the time of day.) Our appointed hour has struck.": "（他轻声说出，如同人报告一天中的时辰。）我们既定的时辰已经到了。",
  "(He sits on a carpet in the shade of the wall, a book open on his knee.) Zaynu'l-ʿÁbidín Khán sent a man to ask why I have raised an army against him. I sent back that my army is two children and their two attendants.": "（他坐在墙影下的毯子上，膝上摊着一本书。）宰努勒-阿比丁汗派人来问，我为何兴兵与他为敌。我回话说，我的军队是两个孩子和他们的两名侍从。",
  "(It is some days before the quarter learns the whole of it. She sits on her doorstep without a lamp, her son asleep with his head in her lap.) Ḥájí Siyyid ʿÁbid. Vaḥíd gave him two letters. One they made him write: go home. One he wrote in secret: do not believe them. ʿÁbid took the secret one to the governor, and brought you the other.": "（过了几天，街区才知道事情的全貌。她没有点灯，坐在自家门阶上，儿子枕着她的膝头睡着了。）哈吉·赛义德·阿比德。瓦希德交给他两封信。一封是他们逼着他写的：回家去。另一封是他暗中写下的：不要相信他们。阿比德把那封暗信送给了总督，却把另一封带给了你们。",
  "(Keep digging.)": "（继续挖。）",
