  "(She sits on her doorstep in the dark, a lamp shielded in her hand.) Keep to the walls. They fire at anything that moves on the roofs, and in summer the roofs are where we live.": "（她在黑暗中坐在自家门阶上，手里护着一盏灯。）贴着墙走。屋顶上只要有东西一动，他们就开枪，而夏天我们正是住在屋顶上。",
  "(She stands in her doorway, very still.) I heard firing at the edge of the town. My son ran out to meet them coming down. Find him. Please. Then come back.": "（她站在门口，一动不动。）我听见城边传来枪声。我儿子跑出去迎接下山的人。找到他。求求你。然后回来告诉我。",
  "(Stay with her.)": "（留在她身边。）",
  "(Take the letter.)": "（接过信。）",
  "(The boy crouches in the hollow of the burnt plane tree.) I have been up to the fort and back twice! Shaykh Hádí's men are on the walls. It is old, the fort, but the walls are thick as a house.": "（男孩蹲在被烧焦的梧桐树的树洞里。）我已经两次跑到堡垒又跑回来了！谢赫·哈迪的人都在城墙上。堡垒是旧的，可墙厚得像一座房子。",
  "(The boy is shaking, his coat torn at the shoulder.) They were waiting at the edge of the town. The governor's men. They let ours come down the road with their hands empty, and then...": "（男孩浑身发抖，外套的肩头撕破了。）他们就埋伏在城边。是总督的人。他们放我们的人空着手沿路下来，然后……",
  "(The hall is lamplit and half empty. He sits by the pulpit, writing.) You have heard? Mullá ʿAbdu'l-Ḥusayn was at his prayers on his own roof, and they fired on him from the governor's. A ball in his right foot. Eighty years old.": "（大厅里灯火通明，却已空了一半。他坐在讲坛旁书写。）你们听说了吗？毛拉·阿卜杜勒-侯赛因在自家屋顶上礼拜，他们从总督的屋顶向他开了枪。一颗子弹打中了右脚。他已经八十岁了。",
  "(The old man lies on a mattress in his yard, his right foot bound in linen gone dark.) Do not look so grave. I was at my prayers on my own roof, and they fired from the governor's roofs. Their aim is better than their manners. Go to Vaḥíd in the masjid. He will be fretting.": "（老人躺在院子里的褥子上，右脚缠着已被血染暗的亚麻布。）别这么一脸凝重。我是在自家屋顶上礼拜，他们从总督的屋顶开枪。他们的枪法倒比礼数强。到清真寺去见瓦希德吧。他一定正焦急。",
  "(Watch him go.)": "（目送他离去。）",
  "A Jug of Water": "一罐水",
