  "The boy from three doors down had touched Vaḥíd's stirrup on the road. The whole quarter had gone out to welcome him, though the governor had threatened death to any who did.": "隔三户人家的那个男孩在路上摸到了瓦希德的马镫。整个街区都出去迎接他了，尽管总督曾威胁说，谁敢这样做就处死谁。",
  "A pit in the court, waist deep, and companions in it with spades and baskets. The governor has cut off the water that came to the fort, and Vaḥíd has bidden them dig a cistern.": "院子里有一个齐腰深的坑，同伴们拿着铁锹和筐子在里面劳作。总督切断了通往堡垒的水源，瓦希德便吩咐他们挖一口蓄水池。",
  "A soldier has been let in at the gate under a white cloth, alone, holding something wrapped in green silk against his chest the way a man carries a sleeping child.": "一名士兵举着一块白布，独自被放进了门内，胸前紧抱着一件用绿绸包裹的东西，就像人抱着熟睡的孩子。",
  "A soldier of the Hamadán regiment brought a Qur'án sealed by the officers, who swore on it that Vaḥíd could come down, set out his Cause, and return in safety.": "一名哈马丹团的士兵送来一部古兰经，军官们已在上面盖了印，并以它起誓：瓦希德可以下来陈述他的主张，之后平安返回。",
  "A town in Fárs west of Nayríz. Twenty of its men walked with Vaḥíd to Nayríz in 1850, against the word of their divines.": "法尔斯的一座城镇，在内里兹以西。1850年，它的二十名男子不顾宗教领袖的劝阻，与瓦希德一同步行前往内里兹。",
  "The boy's mother gave you water at her door. Vaḥíd's house was in Chinár-Súkhtih, and his wife's people were of Nayríz.": "那男孩的母亲在家门口给了你水喝。瓦希德的住宅在奇纳尔-苏赫提，他妻子的亲人是内里兹人。",
  "After three days Ḥájí Siyyid ʿÁbid brought a letter in Vaḥíd's hand bidding the companions go home. They obeyed, and left the fort empty.": "三天之后，哈吉·赛义德·阿比德带来一封瓦希德亲笔的信，吩咐同伴们回家。他们顺从了，把堡垒空了出来。",
  "Alive, and indignant, they tell me, that his prayer was interrupted. (He folds the paper and seals it.) I cannot go to him tonight without bringing the muskets down on his house. Will you carry this?": "据他们说，他还活着，还在恼火祈祷被人打断。（他把信纸折起，封上印。）今晚我若去看他，就会把枪口引到他家里去。你愿意把这封信带去吗？",
  "An old chenar stands in the square, burnt hollow at its foot long ago, one great limb dead and black. The rest of it is still in leaf. The quarter takes its name from such a tree: Chinár-Súkhtih, the burnt plane.": "广场上立着一棵古老的梧桐树，树根早年被烧空，一根大枝已枯死发黑，其余部分仍枝叶繁茂。这个街区便得名于这样一棵树：奇纳尔-苏赫提，即“被烧焦的梧桐”。",
  "An old fort near the Chinár-Súkhtih quarter of Nayríz, where Vaḥíd and his companions held out in June 1850. It was burned to the ground afterward.": "内里兹奇纳尔-苏赫提街区附近的一座古堡，1850年6月瓦希德与同伴们在此坚守。此后它被夷为平地。",
  "Asked why he had raised an army, Vaḥíd answered that his company was two children and their two attendants, and asked why the governor had cut off their water.": "被问及为何兴兵时，瓦希德回答说，他的人马是两个孩子和他们的两名侍从，并反问总督为何切断他们的水源。",
  "At the Edge of the Town": "在城边",
  "Before dawn Vaḥíd went up to the old fort of Khájih with his two sons, their attendants, and the men who chose to follow, so as not to make a battlefield of the quarter.": "黎明之前，瓦希德带着两个儿子、他们的侍从和愿意跟随的人，登上古老的赫瓦杰堡，为的是不让街区变成战场。",
  "Before dawn. Vaḥíd stands on the path below the fort of Khájih with his two sons and their two attendants. Behind him, up the slope by twos and threes, come the men of the quarter who have chosen to follow.": "黎明之前。瓦希德带着两个儿子和他们的两名侍从，站在赫瓦杰堡下的小路上。在他身后，街区里选择追随他的人，三三两两地沿山坡上来。",
  "Burnt Plane Tree": "被烧焦的梧桐",
  "By dusk the pit is deep enough to stand in, and they begin lining it with stones from a fallen corner of the wall. Whatever water they can gather will be kept here. A digger looks at his blistered hands and laughs.": "到了黄昏，坑已深得可以站进去，他们开始用坍塌的一角墙上的石头砌衬里。凡是能收集到的水，都将存放在这里。一个挖土的人看着自己磨出水泡的双手，笑了。",
  "Children have worn the hollow smooth with hiding in it. Above you the living half of the tree turns its leaves in the wind off the hills, as if the fire had been some other tree's trouble.": "孩子们躲进树洞，把洞壁磨得光滑。头顶上，树活着的那一半在自山间吹来的风中摇动叶子，仿佛那场火是别的树的灾祸。",
  "Chinár-Súkhtih": "奇纳尔-苏赫提",
