  "A Letter for Ṭihrán": "一封送往德黑兰的信",
  "A minute a second": "每秒一分钟",
  "A mounted escort leaves Iṣfahán by night toward the capital. You follow at the distance the riders allow, and the cold of the end of winter comes up off the plain.": "一队骑马的押送者在夜里离开伊斯法罕，向都城而去。你在骑手们容许的距离外跟随，冬末的寒气从原野上升起。",
  "A year and more of quiet roads, and then the summer of 1852: the city gates are watched, and every Bábí in Ṭihrán is sought.": "一年多平静的道路之后，便是1852年的夏天：城门有人看守，德黑兰的每一个巴比信徒都在被搜捕。",
  "Ádhirbáyján, July 1850": "阿塞拜疆地区，1850年7月",
  "Ádhirbáyján, summer 1848": "阿塞拜疆地区，1848年夏",
  "Along the foot of the mountains the believers make their way toward the hamlet of Badasht, a few at a time, so as not to be noticed.": "信徒们沿着山脚走向巴达什特小村，三三两两，免得惹人注意。",
  "An hour a second": "每秒一小时",
  "Around the Salt Lake": "绕过盐湖",
  "Baghdád, Kirmánsháh and Hamadán, spring 1847": "巴格达、克尔曼沙赫与哈马丹，1847年春",
  "Behind the Escort": "押送队之后",
  "Búshihr to Shíráz, summer 1845": "从布什尔到设拉子，1845年夏",
  "Búshihr to the open sea, autumn 1844": "从布什尔驶向大海，1844年秋",
  "By Twos and Threes": "三三两两",
  "Chapter {from} to Chapter {to}": "第 {from} 章至第 {to} 章",
  "Cholera empties the streets of Shíráz. The chief constable, his own sons stricken, lets his Prisoner go on the one condition that He leave the city, and the road north to Iṣfahán lies open.": "霍乱使设拉子的街巷空了。总巡长自己的儿子也染了病，他放走了他的囚徒，只有一个条件：祂须离开这座城。通往北方伊斯法罕的路就此敞开。",
  "Continue ›": "继续 ›",
  "East of Ṭihrán toward Sháhrúd, June 1848": "德黑兰以东，前往沙赫鲁德，1848年6月",
  "Facing east": "面向东方",
  "Facing north": "面向北方",
  "Facing south": "面向南方",
  "Facing west": "面向西方",
  "Far to the south, Vaḥíd rides out of Yazd toward his own country of Nayríz, and the villages along the way come out to meet him.": "在遥远的南方，瓦希德策马离开亚兹德，奔向自己的故土内里兹，沿途的村庄都出来迎接他。",
  "Far to the west, Ṭáhirih is sent out of Baghdád, and her company crosses the mountains toward Qazvín, teaching in every town that will listen.": "在遥远的西方，塔希丽被逐出巴格达，她的同伴翻越群山走向加兹温，在每一座肯倾听的城镇里宣讲。",
  "Faster": "加快",
  "From Búshihr a pilgrim ship beats south into the Gulf. Jiddah is two months away if God is kind, and this season the sea is not.": "从布什尔起，一艘朝圣船顶着风向南驶入海湾。若蒙上帝垂怜，吉达尚在两个月的航程之外，而这个季节的海并不仁慈。",
  "From Mashhad into Mázindarán, autumn 1848": "从马什哈德进入马赞德兰，1848年秋",
  "From Yazd into Fárs, May 1850": "从亚兹德进入法尔斯，1850年5月",
  "Hide controls": "隐藏按钮",
  "Home from the pilgrimage, Quddús is sent on ahead up the passes from the Gulf, climbing by night out of the heat toward Shíráz.": "朝圣归来的古杜斯被先行遣上海湾边的山口，夜间攀出酷热，向设拉子而去。",
  "Into the Gulf": "驶入海湾",
  "Iṣfahán to Káshán, March 1847": "从伊斯法罕到卡尚，1847年3月",
  "Iṣfahán, Káshán and Qum, autumn 1844": "伊斯法罕、卡尚与库姆，1844年秋",
  "Journeys": "旅程",
  "Mázindarán to Ṭihrán, winter 1850": "从马赞德兰到德黑兰，1850年冬",
  "Meanwhile, in the West": "与此同时，在西方",
  "Mullá Ḥusayn goes north with a sealed letter for Ṭihrán. He has been told only that the city holds a secret, and that the letter will find it.": "毛拉·侯赛因带着一封封缄的信北上德黑兰。人们只告诉他，那座城里藏着一个秘密，而这封信会找到它。",
  "North in the Heat": "酷暑中北上",
  "Out by the Qur'án Gate": "出古兰门",
  "Out of Mashhad a black standard moves west, some two hundred companions on foot and horseback behind it, down into the forests of Mázindarán.": "一面黑旗从马什哈德向西行进，约二百名同伴或步行或骑马跟在后面，下到马赞德兰的森林里。",
  "Over the snows of the mountains to Ṭihrán, you carry the names of the fallen of Ṭabarsí and say them aloud to no one.": "你踏着山间的积雪前往德黑兰，心里带着塔巴尔西殉难者的名字，却不对任何人念出声来。",
  "Over the Winter Passes": "翻越冬日山口",
  "Pass the journey": "走完全程",
  "{seconds} s a day": "每天 {seconds} 秒",
  "Pause": "暂停",
