  "Play": "播放",
  "Qazvín, Tabríz and Mákú, summer 1847": "加兹温、大不里士与马库，1847年夏",
  "Real time": "实时",
  "Reverse": "倒转",
  "Shíráz to Iṣfahán, autumn 1846": "从设拉子到伊斯法罕，1846年秋",
  "Shíráz to the northern road, summer 1844": "从设拉子到北去之路，1844年夏",
  "Slower": "减慢",
  "Tabríz to Zanján, July 1850": "从大不里士到赞詹，1850年7月",
  "Ten minutes a second": "每秒十分钟",
  "The Báb has been brought from Chihríq to Tabríz once more. The road north is hot even at night, and full of soldiers.": "巴孛又一次从奇赫里格被带往大不里士。北去的路即使在夜里也酷热，路上满是士兵。",
  "The capital, August 1852": "都城，1852年8月",
  "The Cholera Summer": "霍乱之夏",
  "The Letters of the Living leave Shíráz by night, each by his own road, carrying news of a Gate whose name they may not yet speak.": "永生之字在夜里离开设拉子，各走各的路，带着一扇门的消息，而那扇门的名字他们还不能说出口。",
  "The News of Tabríz": "大不里士的消息",
  "Day {n} of {total}": "第 {n} 天，共 {total} 天",
  "The Road to the Mountains": "通往群山之路",
  "The road turns away from the capital, through Qazvín and Tabríz to Mákú, a fortress under a cliff at the far edge of the kingdom.": "道路从都城折向别处，经加兹温与大不里士，通到马库，那是王国最远一隅、悬崖下的一座堡垒。",
  "The Stairways of the Passes": "山口的阶梯",
  "Three hours a second": "每秒三小时",
  "Ṭihrán Again": "重返德黑兰",
  "Trails: comet tails": "星迹：彗尾",
  "Trails: long exposure": "星迹：长曝光",
