  "↓ Walk back to the city": "↓ 步行返回城市",
  "A man need not raise a sword to trouble a city. Sometimes a name spoken in hope is enough.": "一个人无需举剑便能扰动一座城。有时，一个充满希望地被提及的名字便已足够。",
  "A merchant in the bazaar names Him: Siyyid ʿAlí-Muḥammad. His house lies in the quarter north of the mosque. The merchant warns that not all in Shíráz wish Him well.": "集市上一位商人说出了祂的名字：赛义德·阿里-穆罕默德。祂的家在清真寺以北的街区。商人警告说，设拉子并非所有人都希望祂平安。",
  "A Neighbour's Welcome": "邻人的迎接",
  "A Traveller at the Gate": "城门前的旅人",
  "All placeable assets are grouped by category. Scroll the grid and hover an asset for the detail preview.": "所有可放置的资产按类别分组。滚动网格并将鼠标悬停在资产上可查看详细预览。",
  "All placeable player, NPC, and chapter character variants.": "所有可放置的玩家、NPC及章节角色变体。",
