  "A young man of Zarand waited in the caravanserai with a package of sacred writings left for him by his teacher, Mírzá Aḥmad. His name was Yár-Muḥammad. Years later, as Nabíl, he would write the history of these days.": "一位扎兰德青年在驿站里等候，带着老师米尔扎·艾哈迈德留给他的一包圣典抄本。他名叫亚尔-穆罕默德。多年以后，他将以纳比勒之名，写下这些日子的历史。",
